  names:
  - "L\xEDnh Canh"
  - "L\xEDnh Canh"
  - "H\xE0 Nh\xE2n"
  - "H\xE0 Nh\xE2n"
  - "L\xEDnh Canh"
  content:
  - "V\u1EC1 r\u1ED3i sao!"
  - "Anh th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1 \u0111\xE3 ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t h\u1EBFt doanh tr\u1EA1i
    \u0111\xF3 \xE0"
  - "\u1EEA, b\u1ECDn ch\xFAng th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1 r\u1EA5t m\u1EA1nh."
  - "Nh\u01B0ng t\xF4i r\xE8n luy\u1EC7n m\u1ED7i ng\xE0y kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3
    cho vui."
  - "Anh l\xE0m t\xF4i ng\u1EA1c nhi\xEAn \u0111\u1EA5y, m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
    ch\u1EAFc s\u1EBD r\u1EA5t vui."
